{"seq":2,"slug":"bias-fairness-data","title":"数据偏差与公平","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-centric-ai/practice/bias-fairness-data","wordCount":1739,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据偏差与公平\">数据偏差与公平</h1><p>2018 年一个著名案例：某商业人脸识别系统在浅肤色男性上错误率不到 1%，在深肤色女性上却高达 35%。模型架构没问题，损失函数没问题——问题全在训练数据里深肤色女性样本严重不足。这是数据偏差最赤裸的展示，也说明了一个核心论点：模型在敏感维度上的系统性歧视，根子几乎总在数据的代表性失衡。本篇追溯偏差的来源、给出可量化的公平指标、讨论缓解手段。它是 <a href=\"../foundations/data-quality\">数据质量与维度</a> 里代表性维度的伦理延伸，也直接承接 <a href=\"data-governance\">数据治理与合规</a> 的法律要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据偏差指训练数据系统性地偏离它本应代表的真实总体或理想分布，导致模型对某些群体产生不公平的差异化表现。公平 (fairness) 则是衡量这种差异是否可接受的标准。关键在于：偏差不是单一现象，它有多个注入点；公平也不是单一定义，不同定义之间甚至相互冲突。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏差来源</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>典型例子</th>\n<th>关联生命周期阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样偏差</td>\n<td>某些群体被采少</td>\n<td>只有联网用户数据</td>\n<td>采集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史偏差</td>\n<td>数据如实记录了过去的不公</td>\n<td>历史招聘偏向某性别</td>\n<td>采集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标注偏差</td>\n<td>标注者的刻板印象渗入标签</td>\n<td>主观评分带成见</td>\n<td>标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合偏差</td>\n<td>用统一模型套不同子群</td>\n<td>一刀切的医疗阈值</td>\n<td>训练</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>下图展示偏差如何在生命周期的不同阶段注入，并最终汇聚成模型的不公平表现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[真实世界] --&gt;|采样偏差| B[采集数据]&#10;  A --&gt;|历史不公被记录| B&#10;  B --&gt;|标注者刻板印象| C[标注数据]&#10;  C --&gt;|子群样本失衡| D[训练数据]&#10;  D --&gt;|统一模型套全体| E[模型]&#10;  E --&gt; F[子群间表现差异]&#10;  F --&gt; G{公平指标审查}&#10;  G --&gt;|超阈值| H[缓解: 重采样/重加权/约束]\">flowchart TD\n  A[真实世界] --&gt;|采样偏差| B[采集数据]\n  A --&gt;|历史不公被记录| B\n  B --&gt;|标注者刻板印象| C[标注数据]\n  C --&gt;|子群样本失衡| D[训练数据]\n  D --&gt;|统一模型套全体| E[模型]\n  E --&gt; F[子群间表现差异]\n  F --&gt; G{公平指标审查}\n  G --&gt;|超阈值| H[缓解: 重采样/重加权/约束]</pre><h2 id=\"偏差从哪里来-溯源到生命周期\">偏差从哪里来：溯源到生命周期</h2><p>要修偏差，先得知道它在哪一步注入——而它的注入点几乎覆盖整个 <a href=\"../foundations/data-lifecycle\">数据生命周期</a>。</p>\n<p>最上游是采集阶段的采样偏差与历史偏差。采样偏差是某些群体根本没被充分采到（人脸案例正是如此）；历史偏差更微妙——数据采得很准，但它如实记录了一个本就不公的世界（如历史招聘数据反映了过去的性别歧视），照单训练等于把不公固化进模型。往下是标注阶段的标注偏差：标注者的主观刻板印象会渗进标签，尤其在涉及主观判断的任务里。再往下，<a href=\"data-selection-pruning\">数据选择与剪枝</a> 若激进去重或质量过滤，可能误删长尾子群，把代表性失衡进一步放大。</p>\n<p>这个溯源框架的实践意义在于：不同来源的偏差要在不同阶段治理。采样偏差靠补采或重加权，历史偏差靠重新定义标签或去偏目标，标注偏差靠改进 <a href=\"../curation/labeling-annotation\">标注与众包</a> 的指南与标注者多样性。把偏差当成单一问题在训练末端一次性修，几乎注定失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"公平的多种定义-一个不可能三角\">公平的多种定义：一个不可能三角</h2><p>新手常以为「公平」有唯一标准，实则公平有多种互不相容的数学定义，必须先选定再度量。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{Y}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为预测、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 为真值、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 为受保护属性（如性别），三种主流定义是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>人口均等 (demographic parity)：各群体获正向预测的比例相等，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\hat{Y}=1\\mid A=a) = P(\\hat{Y}=1\\mid A=b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>机会均等 (equal opportunity)：在真正例中各群体的真正例率相等，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∣</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\hat{Y}=1\\mid Y=1, A=a) = P(\\hat{Y}=1\\mid Y=1, A=b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>校准 (calibration)：给定预测分，各群体的实际正例率一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键的不可能性结果是：当各群体的基率不同时，人口均等、机会均等与校准三者一般无法同时满足——这是数学定理而非工程缺陷。因此公平不是一个能被「解决」的技术指标，而是一个需要利益相关方依据场景做价值取舍的决策。这也是为什么 <a href=\"data-governance\">数据治理与合规</a> 强调公平要文档化论证，而非交给某个自动指标拍板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓解-在数据侧动手\">缓解：在数据侧动手</h2><p>公平问题的根在数据，因此最对症的缓解也应优先在数据侧进行，而非只在模型或后处理打补丁。</p>\n<p>数据侧缓解主要有三类：重采样（对欠表示子群过采样、对过表示子群欠采样，直接修代表性）、重加权（给少数子群样本更高训练权重）、有针对性补采或合成（为缺失子群补真实数据，或用 <a href=\"../synthetic/synthetic-data\">合成数据</a> 填补——但须警惕生成模型会复制甚至放大源偏差）。模型侧（加公平约束到损失）与后处理侧（调子群阈值）是补充手段，但治标不治本。</p>\n<p>无论用哪种缓解，都必须分群度量、持续监控：在数据集的每一版上分别统计各受保护子群的样本量与下游表现，并把这些统计纳入血缘（见 <a href=\"dataset-versioning\">数据集版本与血缘</a>），让公平审查可对比、可回溯。欧盟《AI 法案》第 10 条已把偏差检测与缓解列为高风险系统的法定义务，并特别允许为检测纠偏而处理敏感属性——这把数据公平从「最佳实践」抬升为「合规要求」，详见 <a href=\"data-governance\">数据治理与合规</a>。</p>\n<p>公平治理的三类反模式，核心都是「用一个数掩盖结构」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只看总体指标</td>\n<td>汇报单一准确率</td>\n<td>子群塌陷被平均值掩盖</td>\n<td>分群分别度量并设阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认单一公平定义</td>\n<td>不选定义直接套指标</td>\n<td>定义间冲突，论证站不住</td>\n<td>按场景选定定义并文档化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末端补丁</td>\n<td>只在模型侧加约束</td>\n<td>治标不治本，偏差根在数据</td>\n<td>优先在数据侧重采样/重加权</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判据是：公平报告应能按受保护属性拆开每一列指标；拆不开，报告本身就藏着偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数据偏差是训练数据系统性偏离应代表的总体，导致模型对某些群体不公平；根子几乎总在代表性失衡而非模型。</li>\n<li>偏差注入点覆盖整个生命周期：采集（采样/历史偏差）、标注（刻板印象）、剪枝（误删长尾），需在对应阶段分别治理。</li>\n<li>公平有人口均等、机会均等、校准等多种互不相容的定义，基率不同时三者无法同时满足，是数学定理而非工程缺陷。</li>\n<li>公平不是可自动「解决」的指标，而需利益相关方按场景做价值取舍并文档化论证。</li>\n<li>数据侧缓解（重采样/重加权/补采合成）最对症，须分群度量、纳入血缘；欧盟《AI 法案》已把偏差检测列为法定义务。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据偏差与公平","id":"数据偏差与公平"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"偏差从哪里来：溯源到生命周期","id":"偏差从哪里来-溯源到生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"公平的多种定义：一个不可能三角","id":"公平的多种定义-一个不可能三角"},{"level":2,"text":"缓解：在数据侧动手","id":"缓解-在数据侧动手"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据集版本与血缘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-centric-ai/practice/dataset-versioning"},"next":{"title":"数据治理与合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-centric-ai/practice/data-governance"}}